Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 06:02:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] docs: describe the gateway address policy, body limit and
 readiness probe

The gateway README documents GATEWAY_INSTANCE_ALLOWED_CIDRS and
GATEWAY_MAX_REQUEST_BODY_BYTES, the instance address policy, the
LimitRequestBody middleware, resolver coalescing and miss caching,
the HTTP readiness probe and the content type of error responses. The
root README notes that local instances need an explicit allowlist, and
the changelog and module mapping list the changes.
